Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses, listed below. The per-file
list (author, source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

- Lucide icons (assets/icons/*.svg) — ISC License. See assets/icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt. The Android
  app turns them into Compose path data at build time.
- Inter typeface (assets/fonts/Inter-*.ttf) — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt.
- JetBrains Mono typeface (assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf) — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt.
- Source Sans 3 and Source Serif 4 typefaces (assets/fonts/SourceSans3-*.ttf, SourceSerif4-*.ttf) —
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-SourceSans3.txt and OFL-SourceSerif4.txt.
- Hyphenation patterns: English (assets/hyphenation/en-us.pat, our own, CC0-1.0) and the Moby
  Hyphenator II word list (assets/hyphenation/en-us.dic, public domain); Polish and Italian
  (hyph-utf8, MIT) and Portuguese (hyph-utf8, BSD 3-clause), each file carrying its notice.
- Fonts from craft-fonts (https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts), an optional build input
  (CRAFT_FONTS_DIR) that is not part of this repository. Builds made with it embed the fonts listed in
  https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts/blob/main/ATTRIBUTION.md under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- Rust crates from crates.io (Cargo.lock lists them), each under its own license.

Downloaded at build time, never in this repository, bundled in the app with their licenses:

- Carlito, Caladea, STIX Two Math and Courier Prime typefaces (from google/fonts, pinned to a commit
  and checked against their SHA-256) — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- Liberation Sans, Serif and Mono 2.1.5 (from liberation-fonts' release, checked against its
  SHA-256) — SIL Open Font License 1.1.

